# {2/B}{2/G}{2/U}, "Look at the top four cards of your library. Put two of them into your hand and the rest into your graveyard."
# Three Moxen pay one coloured mana per symbol. The top four are Ponder, Lightning Bolt, Brainstorm and Island, and the player looks at them: taking three or one, or shuffling
# instead, is refused; Ponder and Brainstorm go to the hand and the Bolt and the Island to the graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Rakshasa's Bargain
Island
Island
Island
Ponder
Lightning Bolt
Brainstorm
Island
Island x9

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Rakshasa's Bargain.Cast
Bot1.Modes()
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Arrange(Ponder; Lightning Bolt; Brainstorm | Island)
! Bot1.Arrange(Ponder | Lightning Bolt; Brainstorm; Island)
! Bot1.Arrange(Shuffle)
Bot1.Arrange(Ponder; Brainstorm | Lightning Bolt; Island)
? Bot1.Looked = Ponder; Lightning Bolt; Brainstorm; Island

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand = Island; Island; Island; Ponder; Brainstorm
Bot1.Graveyard = Rakshasa's Bargain; Island; Lightning Bolt
